# The pinned python:3.13-slim build can leave third-party scanner metadata for
# distributions that are removed in the final application image. The Dockerfile
# explicitly uninstalls msgpack and setuptools, runs `pip check`, and fails the
# build if importlib.metadata can still discover either distribution. Trivy can
# still report stale package metadata from image layers/SBOM data, so keep only
# the exact verified advisory IDs here and remove them when the scanner stops
# emitting the false positives.
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964
CVE-2025-47273
